  PASS  fe-sw1: iccpd reports the keepalive OK
  PASS  fe-sw2: ICCP session established on TCP 8888 in VRF VrfMclagKa, 10.20.255.1 to 10.20.255.0 (iccpd)
  PASS  fe-sw2: iccpd listens on TCP 8888 in VRF VrfMclagKa
  PASS  fe-sw2: iccpd reports the keepalive OK
