== bastion: bastion, the jump host
  PASS  bond0 has 2 slaves
  PASS  bond0 slaves under one aggregator ID
  PASS  bond0 partner MAC is the mclag-system-mac
  PASS  bond0 holds 10.20.3.10/24 and is up
  PASS  default via 10.20.3.1 in the main table
  PASS  management default in table 150 via 172.21.40.1
  PASS  one leg only: no NIC in the BMC VLAN (the render names none)
  PASS  TX checksum offload off on the container's 2 data NICs
  PASS  sshd running
  PASS  lldpd running
  PASS  no DNS or time server runs on the jump host (named, chronyd, dnsmasq absent)
  PASS  the bastion asks the lab's resolvers (dns-res1, dns-res2)
  PASS  the lab root CA published: state/shared/ca/root.crt, subject Tarnwick Lab Root CA
  PASS  the internet intermediate (Tarnwick Lab Internet CA) chains to the lab root
  PASS  the internet intermediate's name constraints: 192.0.2.0/24, upstream.example
  PASS  the kubernetes intermediate (Tarnwick Kubernetes CA) chains to the lab root
  PASS  the kubernetes intermediate's name constraints: 10.20.1.0/24, 10.23.0.0/16, ai.tarnwick.example, cluster.local, k8s-cp1, k8s-cp2, k8s-cp3, kubernetes, kubernetes.default, kubernetes.default.svc
  PASS  the platform intermediate (Tarnwick Platform CA) chains to the lab root
  PASS  the platform intermediate's name constraints: 10.20.0.0/14, 10.24.10.0/24, ai.tarnwick.example
  PASS  no private key under state/shared/ (kubeadm's keys retracted once every control node joined)
  PASS  no kubeconfig for root on the bastion (the admin kubeconfig stays on the init node)
  PASS  no cluster or CA state reaches the bastion (no state/shared/cluster, no state/ca)
